*.tsbuildinfo
# Scratch space stays local, except the Markdown issue tracker that AGENTS.md
# treats as the source of truth for the active feature. A bare `.scratch/` also
# ignored new tracker tickets, so they never reached version control.
.scratch/*
!.scratch/diary-v3-rebuild/
.expo/

# Ignore screenshots and other local image files; keep runtime web icons tracked.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.ico
*.avif
*.heic
*.svg
!/apps/web/public/*.png
!/apps/web/public/*.svg
